    "b-30-pr-process-classification-26": {
      "id": "b-30-pr-process-classification-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The run's end-of-run classification separates boundary-confirmed exact matches from improvements and blocked candidates, yielding the eligible ship set while retaining everything else as durable local evidence. The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "promotion gate",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "./20-score-gate-and-handoff"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " then combines score integration, regression protection, and validation evidence to classify that result as pr_ready, local_only, or blocked."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-pr-process-qa-split-27": {
      "id": "b-30-pr-process-qa-split-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Before anything ships, the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "QA ship gate",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "./30-qa-ship-gate"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " screens the eligible files for score-inflating hacks and routes findings through its repair lane instead of allowing metric gains to override source quality. The split plan then cuts the surviving ship set into a review-sized series at a stable split point, preserving file assignment, lane eligibility, dependency evidence, and validation boundaries."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-pr-process-campaign-28": {
      "id": "b-30-pr-process-campaign-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "One "
        },
        {
          "insert": "durable campaign",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "./40-campaign-and-tracking"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " owns that series through operator-confirmed publication batches, background review observation, and review-and-repair fixer cycles until every series is merged or closed and the operator confirms campaign closure. The workflow-local "
        },
        {
          "insert": "campaign and series progress",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "./10-pr-state"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " semantics explain how that work advances, while the canonical "
        },
        {
          "insert": "PrCampaignState and PrSeriesState",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "../../40-harness-state/10-state-composition/60-pr-state"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " shapes keep the durable representation defined once at the harness-state tier."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
